; Ask "Which ...?" about noun phrase 1
;
; Several objects matched the first noun phrase and ALL was not typed. Takes the
; first word of the phrase (RecBuf1) and the offset RecWork6, saves the record
; with #R$7D74, then prints message $ADCC ("Which {WORD} ?") with the word
; pushed for its {WORD} code. The second entry takes A and HL from its caller
; (HL is pushed as the word; #R$7D98 passes the address $7948 there, not the
; word; see the open question). Continues in #R$7D90.
;
; O:A 0 (from #R$7D90)
; O:F Z
@label=AskWhichNoun1
c$7D83 LD A,($7954)       ; offset of phrase 1
 $7D86 LD HL,($7942)      ; its first word
; This entry point is used by the routine at #R$7D98.
@label=AskWhich
*$7D89 PUSH HL            ; the word for the message
 $7D8A CALL $7D74         ; save the record
 $7D8D LD HL,$ADCC        ; "Which {WORD} ?"
